uts-branch.diff, 2362 lines, read completely)\nCovers: README; new design doc docs/2026-09-01-ellipse-cutouts-design.md (134 lines, fully read); new plan docs/2026-09-01-ellipse-cutouts-implementation-plan.md (383 lines, fully read, 6 tasks RED-first TDD); canonical design doc update (schemaVersion 2→3, CutoutLayer interface with shape discriminator, PaintLayer rename); scripts/test-pwa.mjs adds Oval click in offline journey; src/compositor/compose.ts validateDocument rejects shape not in {rectangle, ellipse} and eraseCutout branches ellipse→ctx.ellipse(0,0,w/2,h/2,0,0,2π) fill under existing translate/rotate/destination-out else fillRect; src/domain/project.ts createProject schemaVersion 3; src/domain/types.ts adds CutoutShape, CutoutLayerV2 (no shape), CutoutLayer extends V2 + shape, ProjectDocumentV2 (schemaVersion 2), ProjectDocument schemaVersion 3; src/editor/state.ts adds CUTOUT_KEYS_V2/V3, hasValidCutoutBase (rect keys + finite positive width/height, finite centers/rotation), isValidCutoutLayerV2Shape, isValidCutoutLayerShape (requires shape in set), hasValidDocumentHeader accepts 1|2|3, migrateProjectDocumentV1 now returns schemaVersion 3 directly, isValidProjectDocumentV2 (full strict loop with v2 cutout keys, paint-after-cutout ordering, dup ids, raster asset refs, MAX_LAYERS), migrateProjectDocumentV2 (maps cutouts to {...layer, shape:\"rectangle\", rect:{...rect}}, layers/assets copied), isValidProjectDocument (schema 3 + v3 cutout validation); addItem names `${shape===\"ellipse\"?\"Oval\":\"Rectangle\"} Cut Out ${n}` and duplicateItem same using source.shape; ItemSpec cutout requires shape; designer-app.tsx replaces boolean drawingCutout with drawingCutoutShape state, SheetKind gains \"cutout-shape\", onChooseCutoutShape checks MAX_LAYERS before opening sheet, onStartCutout(shape) closes sheet/activates edit/sets shape, onCreateCutout(rect, shape) guards `current === null || drawingCutoutShape !== shape` then re-checks cap then dispatches add-item; res